    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8908c5fbe7b6a239bdeb5f52e4e0e89e.poster.avif?t=1751637199\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8908c5fbe7b6a239bdeb5f52e4e0e89e.webm?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8908c5fbe7b6a239bdeb5f52e4e0e89e.mp4?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your business. Raise hygiene levels. Earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/b1c4b1924944c7d97389d83aeeb5e3a4.poster.avif?t=1751637199\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/b1c4b1924944c7d97389d83aeeb5e3a4.webm?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/b1c4b1924944c7d97389d83aeeb5e3a4.mp4?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concert venues, police stations, hospitals, and stadiums... Rush to help people with your toilet caravan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/6df8bb818cba62d7b762baa120d3ae87.poster.avif?t=1751637199\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/6df8bb818cba62d7b762baa120d3ae87.webm?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/6df8bb818cba62d7b762baa120d3ae87.mp4?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build good relationships with locals and officials. Complete tasks. Witness their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/fff57ad43ffb8593dfcff7f911e9df09.poster.avif?t=1751637199\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/fff57ad43ffb8593dfcff7f911e9df09.webm?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/fff57ad43ffb8593dfcff7f911e9df09.mp4?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn extra income with portable toilets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8a9a84c76014c4a5adabc094cb300589.poster.avif?t=1751637199\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8a9a84c76014c4a5adabc094cb300589.webm?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472870/extras/8a9a84c76014c4a5adabc094cb300589.mp4?t=1751637199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island city is clean and well-organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a small problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sewage system shuts down at the slightest fault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is necessary to protect the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the city's boldest and most creative toilet operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Toilet Simulator is a game of hygiene heroism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your business! Place toilets all over the city! Turn your truck into a mobile toilet and help the people in need!</p>",
